{
  "id": "footage-cut",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "实拍快切",
  "keywords": [
    "实拍",
    "素材",
    "航拍",
    "城市",
    "压屏字",
    "纪录片"
  ],
  "when": "用真实素材铺满画面、只压一两行硬短句，靠镜头切换而不是手绘讲事实时",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.footage"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "sans-900",
      "body": "sans-400",
      "num": "latin-700"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#0E0C0A",
      "ink": "#F0ECE4",
      "muted": "#9A8F80",
      "accent": "#C0392B",
      "line": "#2A241D"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "night": "#0E0C0A"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.055,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1,
      "label": 0.8,
      "note": 0.6
    },
    "stroke": [
      1,
      2
    ],
    "forbid": [
      "把实拍素材缩成卡片；必须 rect=[0,0,1,1] 满幅 cover",
      "在实拍上再叠一层字幕；压屏字即正文，字幕必须为 none",
      "自动折行；分行只能由 title 里的 \n 决定",
      "用素材名或 Pexels id 当题材枚举；keywords 只描述检索意图",
      "断网或检索失败时静默留空画面；必须明确降级到内置素材"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "none"
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "soft",
    "volume": 0.1,
    "fadeIn": 2,
    "fadeOut": 2.6,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.04,
      "edge": 0.22
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.055
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
